{"4443450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hardcore Soldier", "steam_appid": 4443450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vengeance or Die.<br><br>Hardcore Soldier is inspired by classic bullet hell, run and gun shooters with feel good control and challenging gameplay.<br>But, this is a brutal no mercy approach that requires player skill, with one life and hit death, game over.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, straightforward, no nonsense game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 10 challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bullets, don't die and get vengeance</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veteran Mode : One life, one hit death and game over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***Trainee Mode : Learn the levels with infinite lives<br>where the player is sent to the beginning of the level when killed<br>and level progress persists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game stats such as kill counts, death counts, best run, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >autosaves stats on death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >player must die to manual save </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vengeance or Die.<br><br>Hardcore Soldier is inspired by classic bullet hell, run and gun shooters with feel good control and challenging gameplay.<br>But, this is a brutal no mercy approach that requires player skill, with one life and hit death, game over.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, straightforward, no nonsense game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 10 challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bullets, don't die and get vengeance</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veteran Mod